# .evanescence

A local-only scratch folder for anything that must **not** go into git:
notes, experiments, exported logs, downloaded files, one-off scripts, and
similar throwaway material.

Everything in this folder is ignored by `.gitignore` except this `.gitkeep`,
which exists so the folder is present in every clone and explains its purpose.

## Rules

- Put files here only for your own local use. Nothing here is shared,
  backed up, or guaranteed to survive a fresh clone or a devcontainer rebuild.
- Do not reference files in this folder from code, tests, scripts, or CI.
  If something is needed by the project, it belongs somewhere tracked.
- Being ignored is not the same as being safe. Secrets still belong in
  `.env`/`.secrets`, and copyrighted Bible text follows the local-only
  workflow in `docs/jw.org/README.md`.
- Before running `git add -f` on anything in here, stop: forcing it defeats
  the purpose of the folder.
